1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: 1430-1714===
2 CONT '''Honoré II, Prince of Monaco''', principe de Monaco, born December 24, 1597 died January 10, 1662 age 64
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Ippolita-Trivulzio/5294796839380123988?through=5294796818400123982 Ippolita Trivulzio]
2 CONT
