2 CONC 4809788890132187 Maria Lando di Valdetaro]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Royal house ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Grimaldi House of Grimaldi]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Honoré II was Sovereign Prince of Monaco. He was the first to be called Prince, but started his reign as Lord of Monaco.
2 CONT
2 CONT More...[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honor%C3%A9_II,_Prince_of_Monaco Wiki - Honoré II, Prince of Monaco]
2 CONT
