1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Disputed Mother 
2 CONT
2 CONT Although several online sources say the mother of this family is Rhoda Ann Faure (Ford), the Bonderant Family Association, which has done extensive research on this family says this:
2 CONT "Jean Pierre married Ann Tanner and they had five children: Joseph, John, Ann, Frances, and Peter."
2 CONT https://www.bondurant-family.org/styled-2/
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.bondurant-family.org/styled-21/  BFA Genealogy Research Committee
2 CONT "The Genealogy Research Committee was established by the BFA membership at the October 26, 2019 annual meeting in Portland, Oregon. Its purpose is “to further our understanding of the various Bondurant family lineages descending f
2 CONC rom John Peter (Jean Pierre) Bondurant and Ann Tanner, and assist Members in moving forward in their research so that they can firmly establish their connections to the correct lineage” using traditional genealogical methods as we
2 CONC ll as DNA testing."
2 CONT
2 CONT The one thing everyone seems to agree on is that her name was Ann. The plaque that the family erected in 1990 says "Jean Pierre Bonderant and his wife Ann. ... He married Ann...  Their five children are John, Peter, Jospeh, Ann an
2 CONC d Frances."  No mention of a birth name for Ann.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also https://www.bondurant-family.org/styled-7/ where it refers to several publications, one of which is ''The Bondurants of America - Ann Tanner's Ancestors'' by Mary Bondurant, (Name: Heritage Papers; Location: Athens, Georg
2 CONC ia, USA; Date: 2009;).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Do not confuse this Ann with any of the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''https://www.geni.com/people/Ann-Ford/6000000024171617735
2 CONT * '''https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Ford/6000000041152853757
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Given name has also been reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anne
2 CONT * '''Ann Gates
2 CONT * '''Elizabeth Anne
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of birth might be 1712.  Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1710 at an unspecified location
2 CONT * circa 1714 in Henrico County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1749 at an unspecified location
2 CONT * 1814 at Buckingham, Buckingham County, Virginia, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Elizabeth Ann Bondurant was born 1712 at Manakintown, Henrico now Goochland County, Virginia the daughter of Jean (John) Pierre and Rhonda Ann Faure Bondurant. She married in 1729, Jaques Faure the son of Pierre and Mary Elizabeth
2 CONC  Agee Faure. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Known Children:
2 CONT Marie FAURE (FORD) 1730-1821 Md James Agee Died Dillwyn, Burkingham County, Virginia Judith FAURE (FORD) 1732-1810 Peter FAURE (FORD) 1734-1801    Magdelind Faure (FORD) 1736-1805 Md William Southern Died Stokes County, North Caro
2 CONC lina Ann FAURE 1738-1810 Rachael FAURE (FORD) 1739- James FAURE (FORD) 1743-1787 Ruth FAURE 1745- Boaz FAURE (FORD) 1749-1810 Died Buckingham County, Virginia
