2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Jacob Bondurant
2 CONT * Born 1 Oct 1711 in Manakin town, Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT * Son of [father unknown] and Rhoda Ann (Faure) Bondurant
2 CONT * [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT * Husband of Amy (Tanner) Bondurant — married about 1753 in Virginia
2 CONT * Father of Sarah Ann (Bondurant) Agee
2 CONT * Died about 1774 at about age 62 in Goochland, Goochland, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT PLEASE NOTE PARENTAGE: This Peter Bondurant was the son of Rhoda Ann Faure and Jeanne (John) Bondurant. Jeanne Bondurant was the son of Joseph and Elizabeth Ann Chastain Bondurant, not Jeanne Pierre Bondurant and Ann Tanner Bondur
2 CONC ant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/GQC7-2R7
2 CONT
2 CONT When Peter Jacob Bondurant was born on 1 October 1711, in Henrico, Virginia, British Colonial America, his father, Jean Pierre Bondurant, was 34 and his mother, Ann Faure, was 27. He married Elizabeth Darby in 1734, in Virginia, B
2 CONC ritish Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 2 daughters. He died in 1774, in Goochland, Goochland, Virginia, British Colonial America, at the age of 63.
