1 NOTE Dr. Joseph Augustine Bondurant (Ann2Faure, Daniel Isaac1) was born in Henrico Co., VA @ 1720.  Joseph died 11 Aug 1806 in Buckingham Co., VA at 86 years of age.  LDS film has death date of 26 Nov 1803.
2 CONT
