1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Updated 28th July 2025,19th July 2023 & 23rd June 2024, by W.J.E.W: Photo provided & confirmed Date of Death year as explained below. Buried in Bolton Street Cemetery, Wellington with husband Wilbraham Frederick Ev
2 CONC elyn Liardet. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Caroline Frederica Evelyn LIARDET''': Caroline's Birth surname 'Liardet' is the SAME as the last name of her spouse Wilbraham Frederick Evelyn LIARDET, '''because''' they were '''1st cousins'''. This is NOT an anomaly. The 'Hea
2 CONC dstone' on Caroline & Wilbraham's grave, shows her Birth year as '''1799''', however, research indicates this may have been incorrectly engraved and her Birth should be: September 8th 1802 as recorded in 'Google'. W.F.E.Liardet's 
2 CONC birth year was 1799 - this may have caused confusion when the Headstone was engraved,
2 CONT
2 CONT Caroline (Carolina) was the Daughter of Countess Félicité-Perpétue Catherine Liardet II, & Major John Robert James William Tell Liardet, Jr. (Félicité-Perpétue later married Charles William Heydon, 4 years after Liardet's death).
2 CONT Mother of: Anastasia Giovanni Liardet; Ann Carolina Philippin Liardet; Caroline Frederica Liardet; Francis Liardet; Louisa Felicia Marie Wright-Moffitt (Liardet); and William Liardet « less
2 CONT
2 CONT Countess Félicité-Perpétue Catherine Liardet was the sister of Joseph-Henri de Paul de Lamanon d'Albe
