1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Updated 7th July 2023 by W.J.E.W. 
2 CONT '''Anastasia Giovanni Liardet''' was Born Sept 29th 1794 - Zakinthos, Ionian Islands, Greece & Baptized one month later on Oct 31st 1794, same place she was born. There is NO CONFIRMATION of her date of death, presumably, about on
2 CONC e month after birth in November 1794. Anastasia was born to Countess Félicité-Perpétue Catherine Liardet (de Paul de Lamanon d'Albe 11) but her record in Google shows she had Four children only and Anastasia is not listed as one o
2 CONC f the four, parhaps as she died as an infant
2 CONT '''Father:''' John Robert James William Tell Liardet. B: January 16th 1775, Grosvenor Place, Westminster, London, England. D: April 1st 1804, of yellow fever. Buried at Trafalgar, Gibraltar.  (Age 29 years) 
2 CONT '''Mother:''' Countess Félicité Perpétue Catherine de Paul de Lamanon d'Albe, B: Apr 29th 1768, Salon De Provence, Bouches-du-Rhone, Provence-Alpes-Cote d'Azur, France. D: July 20th 1845, St Johns-Wood-Terr, Regents Park, Westmins
2 CONC ter, London, England. (Age 77 years)  
2 CONT Siblings of Anastasia Below:
2 CONT 1.   M William Liardet 1794-1867 Married Oct 3rd 1836, Oberwinter, Neuwied, Rheinland-Pfalz, Germany, to Adeline Pinnock 1800-1867
